      "text": "Our ghostwriting contracts cover everything to protect both you and the ghostwriter. They include detailed project scope (book length, genre, number of revisions), clear timelines with milestone deadlines, payment terms and schedule, complete confidentiality agreements ensuring your project remains private, full copyright and rights transfer to you upon completion, revision and feedback processes, and communication protocols. Most importantly, our contracts specify that you own all rights to the completed manuscript and that the ghostwriter will never claim authorship or publicly discuss the project. We also include clauses covering what happens if either party needs to terminate the agreement early. Everything is straightforward and designed to give you complete peace of mind that your book project is protected and your investment is secure."
