        "text": "Yes, scriptwriting and storyboarding are included in our production process. We write the trailer script, including any on-screen text, narration, and visual direction, and develop a complete storyboard showing the visual sequence shot by shot before production begins. You review and approve both before anything is filmed, animated, or assembled. If you have your own script or specific text you'd like included, we're happy to work with that too."
