        "text": "Yes, revisions are built into every stage of our process. You review and approve the script and storyboard before production begins, then review the first assembled cut with the opportunity to request changes to pacing, text, music, colour, and any other element. We revise until you're happy with the final product. Our goal is a trailer you're genuinely proud to share, so we don't rush approvals or treat revision requests as inconveniences."
