    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Can the trailer be customised according to my book's genre and audience?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Absolutely, customisation isn't an optional extra, it's the entire point. A thriller trailer needs tension and pace. A romance trailer needs warmth and emotional pull. A business book trailer needs clean authority. A children's book trailer needs energy and charm. Every trailer we produce is built from scratch around your specific genre, your target audience, and the emotional response you want the viewer to walk away with. We don't apply the same visual template across different categories and hope it works. The genre shapes every creative decision from the first frame to the last."
      }
