        "text": "A standard eBook of around 20,000 to 40,000 words typically takes four to eight weeks from briefing to final delivery, accounting for outlining, chapter drafting, and revision rounds. Shorter eBooks, lead magnets, focused guides, can be completed faster. Longer or more complex projects, full-length fiction, heavily researched non-fiction, multi-chapter instructional content, take longer. We’ll give you a realistic timeline at the start of your project based on your specific eBook and publishing goals, and we communicate clearly if anything changes along the way."
      }
