    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Do I own the rights to my eBook after it is written?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes, completely and from the very beginning. Everything produced belongs entirely to you, the manuscript, the content, and the finished eBook, including publishing rights, adaptation rights, and all future royalties. Our writers work under a confidentiality agreement and have no claim over the work they produce for you. Your name goes on the cover, and the eBook is yours in every legal and creative sense. We retain no rights, credit, or ongoing interest in the work after delivery."
      }
